  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Speakers Program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Speakers Program: The Speakers Program strengthens public affairs outreach through the use of recognized experts in a variety of policy-relevant fields for in-country training, lectures, workshops, seminars, and consultations. These experts pass along their practical skills, thereby creating a multiplier effect within the host country. The Speakers Programs provide a wide range of perspectives, promote recognition of fundamental liberties and individual freedoms in the region, and increase civic participation.</narrative>
  </description>
